WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.870
Umisho EP 1 TLed by YoshiZumi

00:26.310 --> 00:27.630
We'll reach land pretty soon.

00:27.630 --> 00:28.670
I know!

02:32.210 --> 02:33.840
Ok, here we go.

02:33.840 --> 02:35.250
Ready!

02:41.200 --> 02:43.760
This place is Umineko Shougyou High School.

02:43.760 --> 02:45.260
Also known as Umisho.

02:46.120 --> 02:49.270
And this is the Umisho swimming team.

02:50.670 --> 02:53.270
It's getting pretty close to the match with San High School, huh?

02:53.620 --> 02:54.570
Yep, yep.

02:54.570 --> 02:56.270
I wonder what will happen this year.

02:56.770 --> 02:59.780
There are only 5 boys including myself.

03:04.330 --> 03:06.050
And the girls...

03:08.510 --> 03:11.150
...are the majority with 12.

03:12.730 --> 03:17.300
I'm the Umisho swimming team's manager, Okiura Kaname.

03:19.920 --> 03:22.800
Geez, this is way too hot for May.

03:24.160 --> 03:27.310
Then you should get in the pool, Okiura.

03:27.790 --> 03:28.920
Takeda!

03:31.570 --> 03:33.460
Like I said...

03:33.460 --> 03:36.200
I don't want to go into water deeper than knee-level.

03:36.200 --> 03:38.230
Because mermaids will appear.

03:38.230 --> 03:38.930
Shut up!

03:39.860 --> 03:41.320
I guessed right.

03:41.670 --> 03:44.440
Damn it, he's making a fool out of me.

03:46.380 --> 03:49.320
I saw it when I was in elementary school...

03:49.850 --> 03:50.830
A mermaid...

03:51.500 --> 03:54.800
But it wasn't at all like the ones in fairy tales.

04:04.610 --> 04:06.180
Hey!

04:43.480 --> 04:45.460
I-It's trouble!

04:46.010 --> 04:47.840
What's wrong Makio-chan?

04:47.840 --> 04:49.760
Kaname-senpai, p-please listen!

04:50.180 --> 04:51.930
A-At the beach!

04:51.930 --> 04:52.960
The track team!

04:52.960 --> 04:55.270
A-A house from the ocean!

04:55.270 --> 04:57.040
Let's just go!

04:57.040 --> 04:57.890
Where?!

04:57.890 --> 04:58.980
I'm timing someone!

05:00.520 --> 05:03.440
You have to go!

05:01.280 --> 05:02.950
Okiura-kun.

05:02.950 --> 05:04.530
Orizuka-senpai.

05:05.280 --> 05:08.960
Did you time me?

05:08.960 --> 05:11.740
U-Um, yes.

05:12.170 --> 05:16.940
Um, your time was around 2 minutes and 10 seconds.

05:18.230 --> 05:19.960
What do you mean, "around"?!

05:20.360 --> 05:24.190
Are you taking the swimming world's battle of decimals lightly?

05:24.190 --> 05:26.390
I'm sorry.

05:26.390 --> 05:27.670
Geez...

05:27.670 --> 05:29.010
What's wrong with you, Makio-chan?

05:29.360 --> 05:30.910
At the beach!

05:30.910 --> 05:32.590
The track team!

05:32.590 --> 05:35.090
A house from the ocean!

05:43.520 --> 05:44.480
In other words,

05:44.850 --> 05:47.340
the track team was practicing on the beach

05:47.340 --> 05:50.310
and then found an object that looked like a house along the shore of Ono Island.

05:50.310 --> 05:52.030
To put it simply, yes.

05:52.340 --> 05:55.440
Geez, you just wanted to go see it yourself.

05:58.060 --> 05:59.900
It's full of onlookers.

05:59.900 --> 06:01.710
Ah! There it is!

06:02.750 --> 06:04.840
What is that?!

06:08.470 --> 06:10.300
It's really a house on the water.

06:11.940 --> 06:13.140
There are people on it!

06:19.560 --> 06:22.250
A girl...

06:22.250 --> 06:24.120
And an old guy?

06:24.120 --> 06:27.320
A raft house is the romance of the sea!

06:27.840 --> 06:31.330
Dad, there are a lot of people on the beach!

06:31.330 --> 06:34.330
Looks like they're students from the school you're going to attend.

06:35.480 --> 06:37.450
There's so many!

06:37.450 --> 06:39.330
I wonder if they came to welcome you.

06:40.870 --> 06:43.220
Will I be able to make friends?

06:43.920 --> 06:44.330
Do your best.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.720
She's cute.

06:50.720 --> 06:52.100
T-Takeda!

06:52.100 --> 06:53.090
When did you get here?!

06:58.740 --> 07:01.380
I just transferred to Umineko Shougyou.

07:01.380 --> 07:02.600
My name is Ninagawa Amuro.

07:03.640 --> 07:04.820
Nice to you meet you!

07:08.740 --> 07:09.990
Did you see it?

07:09.990 --> 07:10.860
I did.

07:12.570 --> 07:14.870
This is embarrassing.

07:14.870 --> 07:17.110
A-A transfer student?

07:17.110 --> 07:18.520
From the ocean?

07:18.520 --> 07:19.600
Bravo!

07:22.360 --> 07:26.280
I think... I've seen her before...

07:27.210 --> 07:29.210
Oh, that's right.

07:29.210 --> 07:31.090
Gift, gift!

07:32.040 --> 07:34.090
I wonder what grade she's in.

07:34.090 --> 07:35.620
She's really cute!

07:35.620 --> 07:37.030
I'm gonna get that girl!

07:37.030 --> 07:37.600
No, I'm going to!

07:38.600 --> 07:40.810
I just caught this a little while ago!

07:41.160 --> 07:42.950
So, please eat it!

07:48.340 --> 07:49.950
Here you go.

07:50.520 --> 07:53.260
I-I don't want that dead thing...

07:54.070 --> 07:56.160
What is she thinking?

07:56.520 --> 07:57.930
It's alive.

08:01.000 --> 08:01.970
See, see.

08:01.970 --> 08:03.870
What was that for?!

08:04.140 --> 08:06.520
S-She's terrifying...

08:06.520 --> 08:08.590
I saw Senpai's...

08:12.570 --> 08:14.590
U-Um, your face is too close.

08:20.190 --> 08:22.300
What is it?

08:23.250 --> 08:26.060
Haven't we met before?

08:27.250 --> 08:30.280
I-I think so.

08:31.780 --> 08:34.240
B-But, where?

08:36.030 --> 08:37.740
Maybe I'm imagining things.

08:38.950 --> 08:42.760
Could it be that you guys are on the swim team?

08:44.540 --> 08:45.000
Yes.

08:45.370 --> 08:47.500
So what?!

08:47.500 --> 08:49.960
Senpai, calm down!

08:50.360 --> 08:52.630
I can swim too!

08:53.680 --> 08:55.220
H-Hey!

09:10.950 --> 09:14.500
H-Hey, is she alright?

09:14.500 --> 09:16.830
She's not coming up.

09:16.830 --> 09:18.820
Could she have drowned?

09:23.290 --> 09:25.590
Hey!

09:26.330 --> 09:27.440
She's fast!

09:27.440 --> 09:30.550
And she swam that far without taking a breath.

09:44.860 --> 09:48.310
You've already made friends.

09:53.120 --> 09:54.860
She's not bad.

10:01.410 --> 10:02.870
Hey!

10:16.420 --> 10:18.110
What class are you in?

10:18.110 --> 10:18.930
Class 8.

10:20.810 --> 10:22.780
She's already super popular.

10:24.670 --> 10:25.930
You're so cute.

10:30.220 --> 10:33.310
I definitely feel like we've met before.

10:34.860 --> 10:36.570
Good morning!

10:38.810 --> 10:40.940
Your face is too close again.

10:40.940 --> 10:42.670
Getting ahead of us is unfair.

10:42.670 --> 10:43.830
It's not like that.

10:45.150 --> 10:48.540
She's a weird girl, so I don't think I should get involved with her.

10:48.860 --> 10:51.570
Hey, hey, we've definitely met before, right?

10:51.570 --> 10:53.290
Please don't follow me. I don't want to stand out.

10:53.540 --> 10:54.500
What was that?

10:54.900 --> 10:56.640
L-Like I said...

10:57.810 --> 11:00.060
Orizuka-senpai.

11:00.530 --> 11:01.880
Good morning.

11:04.460 --> 11:05.840
She's in a bad mood.

11:06.510 --> 11:08.560
Ninagawa-san, right?

11:08.560 --> 11:09.230
Yes.

11:09.230 --> 11:11.170
Let me talk to you for a minute.

11:12.310 --> 11:13.610
Sure.

11:14.280 --> 11:15.360
Is she gonna get back at her for yesterday?

11:18.780 --> 11:21.420
Umisho's boss has taken action.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.150
A pool!

11:27.830 --> 11:29.660
It's fresh water.

11:30.010 --> 11:31.950
It's 25 meters...

11:37.170 --> 11:40.420
Hey, are you listening to me?

11:43.380 --> 11:46.680
What is Orizuka-senpai planning on doing here?

11:47.430 --> 11:49.220
I saw it yesterday...

11:49.680 --> 11:51.910
You must be pretty good at swimming.

11:53.450 --> 11:54.190
No.

11:57.220 --> 12:02.480
Hey, do you want to race 100 meters with me?

12:02.480 --> 12:03.650
Before home room...

12:03.920 --> 12:05.850
Wait a second!

12:05.850 --> 12:07.060
What are you saying?!

12:07.060 --> 12:08.280
Aren't you an inter-high level swimmer?!

12:08.660 --> 12:12.690
You can't try to get revenge for what she did yesterday!

12:12.690 --> 12:19.000
Okiura-kun, don't interfere with a battle between women.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.500
Y-Yes.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.160
Sure.

12:23.260 --> 12:24.880
Sounds fun.

12:24.880 --> 12:27.970
U-Um, you know, you didn't bring a bathing suit.

12:28.320 --> 12:30.020
I'll let her borrow...

12:30.020 --> 12:31.100
I have one.

12:32.390 --> 12:33.520
She's wearing one!

12:33.800 --> 12:36.570
Well, I wanted to take a dip before going home.

12:36.570 --> 12:37.900
That's not the problem!

12:37.900 --> 12:39.620
Did you bring underwear?!

12:39.620 --> 12:41.760
She does things her own way...

12:48.420 --> 12:52.410
A dip before going home, huh?

12:59.420 --> 13:03.630
Starts with a tropical feeling...

13:03.630 --> 13:06.630
The pool area seems to be noisy.

13:13.790 --> 13:16.280
Her swim from yesterday...

13:16.280 --> 13:19.150
Maybe it just seemed fast

13:19.710 --> 13:22.650
because she was under water the whole time...

13:25.710 --> 13:29.320
But this is just too interesting...

13:30.070 --> 13:32.820
Ninagawa-san, show me your swimming.

13:35.620 --> 13:37.870
Ninagawa-san!

13:37.870 --> 13:40.080
Amuro-chan, do your best!

13:40.080 --> 13:41.380
Don't lose, boss!

13:42.210 --> 13:44.380
Senpai and her?!

13:44.820 --> 13:47.930
It's a 100 meter swim, so you have to turn 3 times.

13:45.280 --> 13:47.310
Thank you, thank you!

13:49.010 --> 13:50.590
I'm Ninagawa Amuro!

13:49.380 --> 13:50.590
Hey, are you listening?

13:50.940 --> 13:51.950
Nice you meet you!

13:51.950 --> 13:53.260
Where are your goggles?

13:55.100 --> 13:56.640
Whatever.

13:55.190 --> 13:56.640
Thank you, thank you!

13:56.910 --> 13:58.240
I'll leave the starting signal to you.

13:58.900 --> 14:00.150
Yeah, yeah.

14:01.640 --> 14:04.300
Orizuka-senpai is being childish.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.860
Then, here we go.

14:07.230 --> 14:08.390
Ready...

14:16.370 --> 14:17.370
Go!

14:20.370 --> 14:22.380
Up?!

14:25.000 --> 14:26.840
What?! Up?!

14:26.840 --> 14:29.120
Hey, what did she do?

14:31.100 --> 14:32.460
She's not here.

14:32.460 --> 14:34.690
Where is she? Where is she right now?

14:34.690 --> 14:38.820
W-What's... with her...

14:45.790 --> 14:47.020
Huh?!

14:51.060 --> 14:54.300
She swims as if she's gliding!

14:54.300 --> 14:55.830
Like a mermaid!

15:03.330 --> 15:04.570
A mermaid.

15:14.710 --> 15:15.930
She's out cold!

15:22.110 --> 15:25.900
Pools are smaller than the ocean!

15:26.250 --> 15:27.910
That's obvious.

15:27.910 --> 15:30.400
It's because you were swimming like that.

15:30.400 --> 15:32.910
Are you okay?

15:34.250 --> 15:36.740
The win goes to me.

15:36.740 --> 15:39.400
Since I finished the 100 meters while you were out cold.

15:39.400 --> 15:40.910
She's an amateur.

15:41.870 --> 15:43.920
But the way she swam...

15:44.930 --> 15:46.510
She can't be.

16:04.830 --> 16:07.080
Dad, wake up!

16:08.970 --> 16:10.280
One more step.

16:11.440 --> 16:14.340
1, 2, 3, 4.

16:17.040 --> 16:21.110
Is she living on that raft?

16:21.110 --> 16:22.580
Looks like it.

16:24.030 --> 16:26.620
I'm gonna find out where she gets that power from when she swims.

16:26.620 --> 16:29.590
But, Orizuka-senpai... is it necessary to be sneaky?

16:29.840 --> 16:31.670
O-Of course.

16:31.670 --> 16:35.580
Because it would seem like I accepted her style of swimming if we aren't sneaky.

16:35.580 --> 16:36.590
So much pride!

16:42.050 --> 16:44.890
U-Um, I didn't do it on purpose.

16:46.810 --> 16:50.880
It seems like Orizuka-senpai is interested in her swimming style.

16:50.880 --> 16:51.820
I...

16:54.920 --> 16:58.250
I have a feeling that we've met before...

17:00.290 --> 17:01.550
You want breakfast?

17:02.040 --> 17:03.330
Okay!

17:03.330 --> 17:05.540
It looks like they're going to eat now.

17:05.540 --> 17:07.040
What are they going to eat?

17:08.550 --> 17:10.320
A barbecue in the morning?

17:10.760 --> 17:12.750
He's cooking some fish.

17:13.110 --> 17:14.990
I wonder what kind of fish this is.

17:14.990 --> 17:16.140
It's pretty!

17:16.140 --> 17:18.010
It's my first time catching a fish like this.

17:20.070 --> 17:22.510
It really looks like a deep sea fish.

17:29.670 --> 17:32.570
Could that be her source of power?

17:33.780 --> 17:35.320
You're putting too much weight on me.

17:39.660 --> 17:41.940
Hey, hey, you're that person from yesterday!

17:41.940 --> 17:43.840
What are you doing here?

17:43.840 --> 17:45.860
What a coincidence.

17:45.860 --> 17:47.330
I was just taking my morning walk.

17:47.330 --> 17:49.510
Then have breakfast with me!

17:49.510 --> 17:50.910
H-Hey!

17:50.910 --> 17:52.590
Don't be so reserved!

17:54.330 --> 17:56.250
So you swam with Amuro.

17:56.650 --> 17:58.840
Please be good friends with her.

17:59.200 --> 18:01.560
Y-Yes, it's my pleasure.

18:01.560 --> 18:03.290
Let's swim again!

18:03.890 --> 18:05.060
You're too friendly.

18:05.630 --> 18:09.060
But this fish is really creepy.

18:14.510 --> 18:18.770
But if this fish is her secret to swimming...

18:27.830 --> 18:29.290
Not bad...

18:29.290 --> 18:30.490
See, see?

18:30.490 --> 18:33.320
I-It's not like I like it or anything.

18:33.320 --> 18:37.760
Hey, aren't you with that guy today?

18:39.050 --> 18:40.460
I don't know where he is.

18:40.460 --> 18:42.670
It's not like we're dating or anything.

18:44.830 --> 18:46.560
What are they talking about?

18:46.820 --> 18:50.700
So, that guy from the other day is on your mind?

18:53.220 --> 18:54.620
It must be love.

18:54.620 --> 18:56.320
I-It's not like that!

18:59.050 --> 19:00.730
What is she doing?

19:02.380 --> 19:04.440
H-Hey, what are you doing?!

19:05.160 --> 19:07.090
S-Stop it!

19:07.090 --> 19:10.160
Nobody is around early in the morning or late in the evening, so I like to swim naked.

19:10.540 --> 19:12.380
But why are you swimming now?!

19:12.900 --> 19:15.430
I still have time until school.

19:22.560 --> 19:25.220
What is with her animal-like behavior...

19:25.220 --> 19:26.650
Is she an idiot?

19:28.830 --> 19:33.210
No, this animal-like behavior is her secret to swimming?

19:33.210 --> 19:37.300
By swimming naked for a long time and getting used to the water...

19:38.920 --> 19:40.650
she learned to swim like that.

19:42.080 --> 19:43.450
Come in!

19:43.450 --> 19:44.700
It feels great!

19:46.500 --> 19:48.540
I understand Ninagawa-san.

19:48.540 --> 19:52.550
If this is how it is, I'll go along with it!

19:52.550 --> 19:54.040
Why is that?!

19:54.290 --> 19:55.510
Here I go!

19:58.040 --> 19:59.190
Take that!

19:59.190 --> 20:01.460
H-Hey, what's that for?!

20:02.050 --> 20:03.930
Take that, take that!

20:05.940 --> 20:08.770
It must be nice to get in the water with such ease...

20:09.180 --> 20:11.240
I guess I'll go to school now.

20:11.240 --> 20:13.020
Before someone sees me.

20:17.220 --> 20:18.480
She saw me!

20:18.790 --> 20:20.270
U-Um, no, it's not what you think!

20:20.270 --> 20:23.520
I was just taking a morning nudity, I mean, morning walk!

20:23.520 --> 20:25.050
So it's, it's a coincidence!

20:25.050 --> 20:26.420
Do you want to swim with me?

20:28.300 --> 20:30.910
N-No, I...

20:38.970 --> 20:40.130
Hey you...

20:41.090 --> 20:42.120
No way!

20:42.120 --> 20:43.630
Did you drag him into the ocean?!

20:44.140 --> 20:44.770
Yeah.

20:44.770 --> 20:47.280
You idiot, he can't swim!

20:49.970 --> 20:56.140
I... didn't know this would... happen again...

20:58.610 --> 21:00.380
Am I going to die?

21:02.590 --> 21:08.770
Then, this is the last image I'll see in my life...

21:33.960 --> 21:35.350
Is this...

21:35.910 --> 21:37.390
Heaven?

21:38.180 --> 21:40.690
Thank goodness, he's alive.

21:41.410 --> 21:45.240
How long do you plan on clinging onto me for?!

21:51.130 --> 21:54.750
Geez, don't make me worry.

21:55.980 --> 21:57.500
I remembered!

21:59.790 --> 22:01.250
Churaumi!

22:05.760 --> 22:08.110
Chura... umi?

22:08.590 --> 22:09.870
That's right!

22:09.870 --> 22:11.640
We met at Churaumi!

22:15.870 --> 22:17.600
Am I wrong?

22:19.780 --> 22:21.300
Churaumi...

22:22.440 --> 22:26.200
That's what they call a beautiful ocean in Okinawa.

22:29.170 --> 22:31.190
H-Hey, wait a second.

22:31.190 --> 22:34.030
Don't tell me you came from Okinawa on that?!

22:34.030 --> 22:34.830
Is that weird?

22:34.830 --> 22:36.720
It's too weird!

22:36.720 --> 22:38.080
How long would it take?!

22:38.940 --> 22:41.120
She's definitely not normal.

22:41.120 --> 22:42.560
Ninagawa Amuro.

23:03.000 --> 23:04.950
The temperature is 31 degrees Celsius.

23:04.950 --> 23:07.350
A summer-like day in May...

23:07.350 --> 23:10.370
She came to Umisho.

24:46.340 --> 24:49.000
Amuro joins the Umisho swimming team.

24:49.000 --> 24:50.750
She gets familiar with the club members.

24:50.750 --> 24:53.260
But with the swimming club captain's rough welcoming,

24:53.660 --> 24:58.850
the guys become a mob, the girls try to escape, and Kaname as well!

24:58.850 --> 25:03.450
And during that, a big breasted swimmer that looks pure from her appearance, Shizuoka Mirei...

25:03.450 --> 25:06.030
But she's actually...

25:06.620 --> 25:09.610
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho,

25:09.960 --> 25:13.060
"I... might be... Interested..."
